      "id": "claim_cf80b026e3b44496adbf1b13ada6abd7",
      "statement": "Load-bearing framework logic is external: command registry, STEPPATH/contexts, UI and usage templates come from smallstep/cli-utils; CA HTTP client, provisioner types, authority, and pki bootstrap from smallstep/certificates; and JOSE/PEM/key/x509/KMS/TPM primitives from go.step.sm/crypto, into which the CLI installs its own WriteFile/PromptPassword hooks.",
