    {
      "id": "claim_2788a1cd734644a195533149518e3208",
      "statement": "In --offline mode the CLI embeds a full CA in-process: NewOfflineCA parses a step-ca config file into certificates/authority and implements the same CaClient interface, cached in a package-level singleton because double initialization can fail on locking backends such as BadgerDB.",
